<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51895" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθυβρίζω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>treat despitefully, insult</i>, c. acc., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				522
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῶμ᾽ ἐμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>El.</u>
					698
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>PHal.</u>
				1.210
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.574
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ταῦτα αὐτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					616
				</span></i>
			 (troch.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν δῆμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					631
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLit.Lond.</u>
				52.2
			</span></i>: c. acc. cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὰ κ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Crass.</u>
				29
			</span></i>: also c. gen., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				960
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1364
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>OC</u>
				1535
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Vit.</u>
				p.12J.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθυβρίζεται τοιαῦτα τῶν
				Χειρωνακτέων ὑπὸ τῶν ἀνθρώπων</span> such <i>are
				occasions of</i> the practitioners <i>being mocked</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				44
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. dat.,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.212
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				4.27.3
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. εἰς θυγατέρας</span>
			dub. l. in <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				11.2
			</span></i>.</div>
